    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15968" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχι-μάγειρος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ],
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chief cook,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				39.1
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.63
			</span></i>; title of a great officer in Oriental courts, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Da.</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				10.10.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.11b
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχι-μᾰγειρεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
				ὁ, <i>dignitary</i> in Mithraic cult, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				37.97
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thessalonica</span>).</div>
